#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:96
msgid "Connection Info for Support Engineers"
msgstr "支持工程师连接信息"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:5 882735dd1240477cb0060d4b01ee9839
msgid "Partner Support Proxy"
msgstr "合作伙伴支持代理"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:7 1d762bc6b906492aabd57a4268df226d
msgid ""
"This page tells you how to take advantage of the ArduPilot MAVLink support "
"proxy at `support.ardupilot.org <https://support.ardupilot.org>`__. You have"
" likely been directed here by an ArduPilot support engineer who is wanting "
"you to use the proxy to allow the support engineer to connect to your "
"vehicle to assist you."
msgstr ""
"本页面介绍如何使用 `support.ardupilot.org <https://support.ardupilot.org>`__ 的 "
"ArduPilot MAVLink 支持代理。您可能是被 ArduPilot "
"支持工程师引导至此，他们希望您使用该代理，以便连接到您的飞行器并为您提供帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:14 f82833de1e6946eab122b2d91d95e008
msgid "About the Support Proxy"
msgstr "关于支持代理"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:16 1a0b62d3c41848cfab27873429f43d07
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot partner support proxy allows users vehicles running ArduPilot "
"to connect to a support engineer. Key features:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 合作伙伴支持代理允许运行 ArduPilot 的用户飞行器连接到支持工程师。主要特性："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:19 28583834c5d04750b49e93ae52b5d109
msgid "uses MAVLink2 signing to maintain security"
msgstr "使用 MAVLink2 签名以保障安全"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:20 d8491044f2be4c70b7e9ca059b7042bc
msgid "does not need a public IP address for either user or support engineer"
msgstr "用户和支持工程师均无需公网 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:23 561ca2331cab454bbffd14aa52a46c38
msgid "Connecting to the Support Proxy"
msgstr "连接到支持代理"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:25 72fa557277594d3a800a9d97f104379f
msgid ""
"Your support engineer will have given you a number which you should use when"
" connecting. It will be a 5 or 6 digit number. In the diagrams below we will"
" use the example number '10001'. Please replace that with the number you "
"have been told to use."
msgstr "您的支持工程师会提供一个连接用的编号，为 5 位或 6 位数字。以下示例使用「10001」，请将其替换为您被告知的编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:30 de43ec565be6483fbaeebdc3bbc43680
msgid ""
"To get started, select the Support Proxy option under Setup->Advanced in "
"MissionPlanner:"
msgstr "首先，在 MissionPlanner 的「Setup」->「Advanced」中选择「Support Proxy」选项："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:36 89cd950e379d4de3af3f38dc43ba916c
msgid ""
"If you don't see this option then you have an old version of MissionPlanner "
"and should update to the latest release."
msgstr "如果看不到此选项，说明您的 MissionPlanner 版本过旧，请更新至最新版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:39 e90d127f9d8e4542ace94a8199d4f348
msgid ""
"Next enter the 5 or 6 digit ID that your support engineer have you and press"
" connect:"
msgstr "接下来输入支持工程师提供的 5 位或 6 位 ID，然后点击连接："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:44 0dab394894c84c28a18f17abfb983403
msgid ""
"at this point you are streaming your mavlink data to the proxy server. The "
"support person will be able to connect and help you. You can click the Stop "
"button to stop forwarding your link."
msgstr "此时您的 MAVLink 数据正在流式传输到代理服务器，支持人员将能够连接并为您提供帮助。您可以点击「Stop」按钮停止转发链路。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:50 a226e039f1964fb4849a8eb61f4e13c5
msgid ""
"Please close MissionPlanner completely when you have finished with your "
"support session to ensure the port is released."
msgstr "支持会话结束后，请完全关闭 MissionPlanner 以确保端口释放。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:54 1929a17ca80f42cbb840c0d2076b22b1
msgid "Connecting with QGroundControl"
msgstr "通过 QGroundControl 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:56 255e6b919a75424c9b6e8187964acf2e
msgid ""
"To forward your connection to the support engineer from QGroundControl you "
"need to use this configration setting:"
msgstr "要从 QGroundControl 将您的连接转发给支持工程师，需要使用以下配置设置："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:62 4e33e5995c7b47f29e7d58b9a0cf1cdb
msgid ""
"You need to put support.ardupilot.org:XXXXX where XXXXX is the support port "
"number your support engineer has given you."
msgstr "填写 support.ardupilot.org:XXXXX，其中 XXXXX 是支持工程师提供的端口号。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:67 c39a2de251544557ab39461831fd2dc6
msgid ""
"Please remember to untick the \"Enable MAVLink forwarding\" option when your"
" support session is completed!"
msgstr "支持会话结束后，请记得取消勾选「Enable MAVLink forwarding」选项！"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:75 5dbc1d87009c4660af7d6c5d825e05d7
msgid "Connecting With MavProxy"
msgstr "通过 MavProxy 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:77 67af13d918074345b04ec299902d3d76
msgid ""
"If you use mavproxy instead of MissionPlanner then you should add connect "
"like this:"
msgstr "如果您使用 mavproxy 而非 MissionPlanner，应按以下方式连接："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:83 dad87c73f7db49efb80114671c30e3c0
msgid ""
"or instead you can do “output add support.ardupilot.org:10001” from an "
"already connected session."
msgstr "或者，也可以在已连接的会话中执行「output add support.ardupilot.org:10001」。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:86 0caa750012114a8db51fe9896eb40d11
msgid "CAN Management"
msgstr "CAN 管理"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:88 11d341cd3c7a422cb2256387bea4e9e9
msgid ""
"Note that as CAN packets can be forwared over MAVLink you can configure "
"DroneCAN devices remotely via the proxy. Use the MAVLink-CAN1 or MAVLink-"
"CAN2 buttons in Setup->Optional Hardware->DroneCAN to start looking at the "
"remote CAN bus."
msgstr ""
"由于 CAN 数据包可通过 MAVLink 转发，您可以通过代理远程配置 DroneCAN 设备。在「Setup」->「Optional "
"Hardware」->「DroneCAN」中使用「MAVLink-CAN1」或「MAVLink-CAN2」按钮，即可查看远程 CAN 总线。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy.rst:94 647bddf977434c3eb71661cf1dee8457
msgid "Connecting as a Support Engineer"
msgstr "以支持工程师身份连接"
